WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:05.270
<i>The first match between Nankatsu FC vs. Meiwa FC</i>

00:05.610 --> 00:08.150
<i>began with a clash of the aces from each team.</i>

00:09.360 --> 00:12.440
<i>Using a marvelous heel lift, Tsubasa got around Kojiro,</i>

00:12.440 --> 00:14.530
<i>allowing him to score the first goal of the match.</i>

00:15.080 --> 00:17.740
<i>Not to be outdone, Kojiro unleashed a powerful, long-range shot</i>

00:17.740 --> 00:19.830
<i>that managed to blow the goalkeeper away.</i>

00:21.200 --> 00:26.330
<i>After experiencing his power first-hand, Morisaki was frozen with fear.</i>

00:26.330 --> 00:27.790
Take that!

00:27.790 --> 00:28.710
Morisaki, get it!

00:28.710 --> 00:30.500
You can get it!

00:31.440 --> 00:33.300
Nice cover, Tsubasa!

00:34.500 --> 00:38.010
Morisaki, the ball is your friend! Don't be afraid!

00:38.010 --> 00:39.100
Eh?

00:39.100 --> 00:41.590
What's with this "the ball is your friend" garbage?!

00:41.590 --> 00:44.850
If that's the case, then take this ball, too!

00:45.060 --> 00:45.560
Tsubasa, watch out!

00:45.560 --> 00:46.440
Tsubasa!

00:46.990 --> 00:49.440
<i>He got hit right in the face!</i>

00:50.730 --> 00:51.650
What?

00:51.650 --> 00:53.690
Tsubasa!

00:55.980 --> 00:58.360
See, it's fine.

01:00.200 --> 01:01.200
I get it...

01:01.200 --> 01:03.510
I won't be afraid anymore.

01:03.510 --> 01:04.800
I'll give it a try.

01:05.500 --> 01:07.370
<i>Take this! Once more!</i>

01:08.360 --> 01:10.750
Morisaki, nice catch!

01:11.370 --> 01:14.170
The football is my precious friend.

01:14.170 --> 01:15.800
Like I'd ever let it go!

01:15.800 --> 01:17.890
Damn that runt!

01:17.890 --> 01:20.720
He got that goalkeeper back on his feet again!

01:21.550 --> 01:23.130
<i>It's time to counter, Tsubasa!</i>

01:23.130 --> 01:24.560
<i>I'm entrusting my friend to you!</i>

01:25.100 --> 01:28.410
<i>All right! This time, it's our turn to attack!</i>

01:42.050 --> 01:47.680
<i>The smell of the grass when I stumbled,</i>

01:42.050 --> 01:47.680
<i>koronda toki no shibafu no nioi</i>

01:47.680 --> 01:52.680
<i>the endless blue of the sky above...</i>

01:47.680 --> 01:52.680
<i>aogimita sora no ao hateshinakatta</i>

01:53.350 --> 01:58.520
<i>This winding, back-and-forth path</i>

01:53.350 --> 01:58.520
<i>mayotte modori susumu kidô ga</i>

01:59.230 --> 02:06.850
<i>is a map for our endless dreams</i>

01:59.230 --> 02:06.850
<i>hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu</i>

02:06.850 --> 02:12.620
<i>Even if my hopes miss the goal</i>

02:06.850 --> 02:12.620
<i>goal o soreta kibô ga atte mo</i>

02:12.620 --> 02:21.130
<i>if I stand back up, my dreams will never end</i>

02:12.620 --> 02:21.130
<i>mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai</i>

02:21.130 --> 02:26.930
<i>No.1! Race forth, faster than anyone</i>

02:21.130 --> 02:26.930
<i>No. 1! dare yori hayaku kakenuke</i>

02:26.930 --> 02:32.850
<i>Make a starting dash toward the world stage with your tricky plays!</i>

02:26.930 --> 02:32.850
<i>tricky na play de sekai e muke Start! Dash!</i>

02:32.850 --> 02:34.350
<i>Run & Run!</i>

02:34.350 --> 02:41.650
<i>Aspirations are the one buzz, buzz, buzz that gets us moving</i>

02:34.350 --> 02:41.650
<i>akogare dake ga boku-ra o chiri-chiri-chiri ugokasu yo
</i>

02:41.650 --> 02:44.570
<i>Blaze, blaze, blaze! Let's go, it's kickoff!</i>

02:41.650 --> 02:44.570
<i>mera-mera-mera iku ze kickoff</i>

02:44.570 --> 02:49.490
<i>Leap out into a giant field of dreams</i>

02:44.570 --> 02:49.490
<i>tobidasô dodekai dream field</i>

03:00.450 --> 03:04.700
<b><b>EPISODE 15:
IT'S MY DREAM, SO I WON'T LOSE!</b></b>

03:00.940 --> 03:02.950
<i>We are in Group 1's first match of the group stage,</i>

03:02.950 --> 03:05.070
<i>here at the National Youth Football Tournament.</i>

03:05.070 --> 03:07.840
<i>There's only a little time left before the end of the first half.</i>

03:07.840 --> 03:10.540
<i>The match is Nankatsu vs. Meiwa, and Meiwa lead with a 2-1 score.</i>

03:10.540 --> 03:13.500
<i>Tsubasa dashes forward to attack with the ball!</i>

03:13.500 --> 03:15.230
I'm going in, Misaki!

03:15.230 --> 03:16.290
Yes!

03:16.290 --> 03:20.130
Let's teach Kojiro that the football is our friend.

03:20.130 --> 03:21.970
What the hell is with that "friend" crap?

03:21.970 --> 03:23.720
Don't let those two pass.

03:23.720 --> 03:25.190
Stop them, no matter what!

03:25.190 --> 03:26.180
Okay!

03:26.180 --> 03:27.390
Like I'd let you!

03:27.930 --> 03:28.760
Misaki!

03:30.110 --> 03:30.980
Tsubasa!

03:30.980 --> 03:33.960
<i>Here they go! It's Nankatsu's Golden Duo!</i>

03:33.960 --> 03:36.960
<i>Tsubasa and Misaki control the ball freely</i>

03:36.960 --> 03:39.610
<i>and advance into Meiwa's side as if they were one.</i>

03:40.530 --> 03:41.190
Damn it!

03:41.190 --> 03:43.360
Let's get to the goal, Misaki!

03:43.360 --> 03:44.070
Yeah!

03:44.070 --> 03:45.660
I will stop you!

03:46.170 --> 03:48.210
<i>Did he read the course of the pass?</i>

03:48.210 --> 03:49.870
<i>Hyuga moves to intercept it!</i>

03:49.870 --> 03:50.790
<i>I got this!</i>

03:53.590 --> 03:54.330
<i>What?</i>

03:54.330 --> 03:56.040
<i>The ball changes course!</i>

03:56.040 --> 03:58.600
<i>Did Misaki foresee that Hyuga would try to cut this?</i>

03:58.600 --> 04:01.130
<i>Is this Misaki's assist to Tsubasa?</i>

04:01.500 --> 04:03.880
<i>I'll just have to block the shot!</i>

04:03.880 --> 04:06.100
Take my friend, Misaki!

04:06.100 --> 04:09.840
<i>He doesn't shoot! Tsubasa sends the final pass in front of the goal!</i>

04:09.840 --> 04:11.020
<i>These guys...</i>

04:11.020 --> 04:13.560
<i>Misaki runs towards the ball!</i>

04:14.310 --> 04:16.060
<i>Goal!</i>

04:17.520 --> 04:21.400
<i>Just before the end of the first half, Nankatsu ties the score!</i>

04:22.250 --> 04:24.500
Nice shot, Misaki!

04:24.500 --> 04:26.740
Nice pass, Tsubasa!

04:28.070 --> 04:30.490
Doing good, Misaki!

04:31.770 --> 04:33.500
<i>It's the end of the first half!</i>

04:33.500 --> 04:36.750
<i>We will be moving into the second half all tied up at 2-2. </i>

04:36.750 --> 04:39.130
Good going, Nankatsu!

04:39.130 --> 04:41.500
Tsubasa! Misaki!

04:42.460 --> 04:43.420
You did it!

04:43.420 --> 04:44.360
Yes.

04:54.820 --> 04:58.310
There's no way to predict how this game will end.

04:58.310 --> 05:00.900
Thank you, guys.

05:00.900 --> 05:02.610
Well played, Tsubasa.

05:02.610 --> 05:04.410
Thanks, Ishizaki.

05:04.410 --> 05:06.150
You all did well, guys.

05:06.150 --> 05:08.020
It was important to tie before half time.

05:08.020 --> 05:09.110
Yes!

05:09.110 --> 05:11.330
Morisaki, will you be all right in the second half?

05:11.330 --> 05:15.720
Yes. Leave it to me, please. I'll protect our goal!

05:15.720 --> 05:17.330
You guys can attack without worrying about the goal!

05:17.330 --> 05:18.580
Okay!

05:18.580 --> 05:21.920
All right! As soon as the second half starts, we'll go as hard as we can!

05:21.920 --> 05:24.320
Just keep on attacking until the end!

05:24.320 --> 05:25.670
Yes!

05:25.670 --> 05:26.380
Damn it!

05:27.780 --> 05:30.230
It's come to this. It's a scoring showdown!

05:30.850 --> 05:34.180
Keep giving the ball to me. I'll definitely score goals!

05:34.180 --> 05:36.810
Bring the ball in front of the goal as if your life depended on it!

05:37.420 --> 05:39.980
There's no such thing as defeat within Meiwa's football!

05:39.980 --> 05:40.730
Yes!

05:40.730 --> 05:46.550
<i>That Tsubasa kid has really lit a fire under him.</i>

05:46.550 --> 05:47.780
That's it, Kojiro.

05:48.420 --> 05:50.610
Attacking is the best kind of defense.

05:50.610 --> 05:52.880
Hold down your enemies with your strength.

05:52.880 --> 05:53.780
Yes!

05:54.600 --> 05:57.990
<i>I didn't come here to lose.</i>

05:57.990 --> 06:01.250
<i>And absolutely not to the likes of them!</i>

06:02.350 --> 06:06.390
Everyone's doing their best while making up for your absence in the team.

06:06.390 --> 06:07.090
Yes.

06:07.560 --> 06:10.710
All right! Keep going like that in the second half too.

06:10.710 --> 06:13.220
Tsubasa! Misaki! Morisaki!

06:13.960 --> 06:17.000
<i>Genzo, you want to play too, don't you?</i>

06:17.000 --> 06:20.390
<i>But for now, you must be patient.</i>

06:20.810 --> 06:23.010
<i>The players come out onto the field.</i>

06:23.010 --> 06:25.480
<i>The second half is about to begin.</i>

06:25.480 --> 06:27.490
It's the second half.

06:27.490 --> 06:29.860
The score will be settled in this half.

06:29.860 --> 06:31.240
Tsubasa...

06:31.240 --> 06:32.990
Tsubasa vs. Hyuga...

06:32.990 --> 06:35.120
Don't lose, Misaki.

06:35.780 --> 06:37.620
This will be the last part of their duel.

06:37.620 --> 06:41.580
Now we'll see who is better, Tsubasa or Kojiro.

06:42.770 --> 06:46.380
<i>I'll show you how I play football when I'm serious.</i>

06:46.380 --> 06:48.340
<i>Tsubasa Ozora!</i>

06:49.590 --> 06:52.340
<i>The second half is underway!</i>

06:52.810 --> 06:56.470
<i>And here it is! The team that wins the initiative is Nankatsu.</i>

06:56.470 --> 07:01.300
<i>Misaki, who is in high spirits after scoring the equalizer in the first half,</i>

07:01.300 --> 07:03.350
<i>steals the ball and skillfully dribbles forward.</i>

07:03.350 --> 07:04.400
Don't let him through!

07:04.400 --> 07:05.270
Yes!

07:05.270 --> 07:07.070
<i>Meiwa comes with a barrage of tackles!</i>

07:07.940 --> 07:09.780
<i>Misaki manages to hold on!</i>

07:11.320 --> 07:13.070
Don't get too carried away!

07:13.800 --> 07:16.370
<i>Hyuga strips the ball from Misaki!</i>

07:16.370 --> 07:19.370
<i>It was a rough tackle, on the verge of a foul!</i>

07:19.370 --> 07:22.750
With a playstyle like yours, you have no chance of beating us!

07:23.440 --> 07:27.920
In this second half, you will cry after we make you witness our true strength!

07:27.920 --> 07:29.210
I won't let you have it!

07:29.210 --> 07:31.220
<i>Nankatsu attempts to steal the ball!</i>

07:33.300 --> 07:35.890
<i>This time, he directly hits Izawa!</i>

07:35.890 --> 07:36.760
Izawa!

07:37.370 --> 07:38.100
Takeshi!

07:38.570 --> 07:41.770
<i>He passes the ball to Sawada and starts running.</i>

07:42.550 --> 07:43.350
Hyuga!

07:43.350 --> 07:45.480
<i>Sawada sends a cross in!</i>

07:45.480 --> 07:47.690
I won't run away... I'll stop this!

07:48.650 --> 07:51.190
Eat this!

07:51.190 --> 07:52.530
<i>A direct shot!</i>

07:53.820 --> 07:55.860
<i>It's in!</i>

07:55.860 --> 07:58.420
<i>This time, instead of aiming for the keeper,</i>

07:58.420 --> 08:00.660
<i>Hyuga's skillful shot gets away from him and finds the goal!</i>

08:00.660 --> 08:04.170
<i>Meiwa leads again with 3-2.</i>

08:04.170 --> 08:05.340
Izawa!

08:05.340 --> 08:07.570
Are you all right, Izawa?

08:07.570 --> 08:08.510
Yeah...

08:09.390 --> 08:11.250
Do you get it now, Nankatsu?

08:12.090 --> 08:14.340
This is our football!

08:16.590 --> 08:19.600
Just keep on going! We'll turn things around!

08:20.020 --> 08:22.360
<i>It's Nankatsu's counter-attack this time.</i>

08:22.360 --> 08:23.350
We won't lose!

08:25.700 --> 08:26.600
Kisugi!

08:27.600 --> 08:28.360
Taki!

08:28.740 --> 08:29.730
Okay!

08:29.730 --> 08:31.800
<i>Nankatsu is not giving up yet!</i>

08:31.800 --> 08:33.990
<i>Their attack is in perfect sync!</i>

08:33.990 --> 08:36.490
Go to Tsubasa! Don't leave Tsubasa alone!

08:38.530 --> 08:40.240
Take this, Misaki!

08:40.240 --> 08:42.750
<i>The ball goes to Misaki, the playmaker.</i>

08:42.750 --> 08:46.600
<i>However, Tsubasa is overwhelmingly marked!</i>

08:47.040 --> 08:47.630
Eh!?

08:48.310 --> 08:51.550
<i>Tsubasa makes a quick feint and shakes them off!</i>

08:51.550 --> 08:52.550
What?

08:53.260 --> 08:54.010
Tsubasa!

08:57.680 --> 09:00.140
<i>It's a diving header from Tsubasa!</i>

09:00.670 --> 09:03.850
<i>Nankatsu catches up again and ties the score!</i>

09:05.140 --> 09:06.560
God damn it!

09:07.260 --> 09:10.820
<i>This has become a fierce match!</i>

09:10.820 --> 09:14.090
<i>Both teams try to get past each other and get the ball</i>

09:14.090 --> 09:19.010
<i>to their respective strikers, Hyuga and Tsubasa, who are set up in front of the others' goals!</i>

09:19.010 --> 09:21.780
<i>Any time a ball gets to either of them,</i>

09:21.780 --> 09:24.670
<i>they are both sure to score!</i>

09:24.670 --> 09:27.680
<i>There's no way to predict the outcome of this match!</i>

09:29.790 --> 09:32.800
<i>Nankatsu has caught up once again!</i>

09:36.090 --> 09:37.770
<i>The score is 5-5.</i>

09:37.770 --> 09:42.130
<i>Under the scorching sun, Nankatsu and Meiwa—Tsubasa and Hyuga—</i>

09:42.130 --> 09:43.900
<i>they both refuse to yield!</i>

09:43.900 --> 09:46.280
<i>There are only 5 minutes left in the game.</i>

09:46.280 --> 09:48.060
That bastard...

09:48.060 --> 09:51.170
Both teams are on the same level, that's for sure.

09:51.170 --> 09:55.280
With this terrible heat, it's a battle of willpower over technique.

09:55.280 --> 10:00.980
<i>This is a game between two players who put</i>

10:00.980 --> 10:03.410
<i>their full feelings into their style of football</i>

10:03.410 --> 10:05.160
<i>Like I'd ever lose!</i>

10:05.160 --> 10:08.210
<i>Who will score next? Nankatsu or Meiwa?</i>

10:09.790 --> 10:13.790
<i>Sawada recovers the ball and brings the ball out to the wing.</i>

10:14.140 --> 10:14.840
Give it to me!

10:16.160 --> 10:17.240
Hyuga!

10:17.240 --> 10:18.920
<i>Sawada crosses the ball!</i>

10:18.920 --> 10:20.180
<i>It's a high one!</i>

10:22.160 --> 10:25.510
<i>No matter what happens, I can't lose!</i>

10:26.770 --> 10:29.810
I simply cannot lose!

10:30.560 --> 10:32.060
<i>It's a heading battle!</i>

10:35.900 --> 10:37.440
<i>Goal!</i>

10:38.490 --> 10:42.450
<i>On the 16th minute of the second half, Meiwa pulls ahead by one again!</i>

10:42.450 --> 10:45.740
<i>So, can we say that Hyuga won this with his large build?</i>

10:45.740 --> 10:46.910
Did you see that?

10:46.910 --> 10:50.960
My football is greater than your mere child's play!

10:50.960 --> 10:52.420
We... are not playing around!

10:52.420 --> 10:53.810
What?

10:53.810 --> 10:57.330
Football... football is my dream!

11:06.460 --> 11:09.190
<i>Now there's very little time remaining,</i>

11:09.190 --> 11:10.730
<i>with only four minutes left until the final whistle!</i>

11:10.730 --> 11:12.430
<i>Can Nankatsu catch up?</i>

11:12.430 --> 11:14.770
Let's go! We'll catch up, for sure!

11:14.770 --> 11:18.070
We will defend this goal until the end!

11:18.070 --> 11:21.430
<i>Tsubasa Ozora... what dream?!</i>

11:21.430 --> 11:23.990
<i>Football isn't a game for children!</i>

11:23.990 --> 11:26.370
<i>I'll make you learn!</i>

11:26.770 --> 11:27.870
<i>The match resumes!</i>

11:27.870 --> 11:31.290
<i>Nankatsu moves forward with everyone!</i>

11:31.290 --> 11:33.130
Go, Nankatsu!

11:33.130 --> 11:35.290
Get that tie!

11:35.290 --> 11:37.170
I'm counting on you, Tsubasa.

11:37.170 --> 11:41.920
<i>Nankatsu is trying to connect with their ace, Tsubasa,</i>

11:41.920 --> 11:46.970
<i>But Tsubasa is being marked right next to the goal by Hyuga!</i>

11:46.970 --> 11:51.620
Tsubasa! I will stop anything that comes your way!

11:53.100 --> 11:54.640
Damn you, Hyuga...!

11:54.640 --> 11:56.360
Watch out, Urabe!

11:57.360 --> 11:59.110
<i>Nankatsu loses the ball!</i>

11:59.110 --> 12:00.490
Attack!

12:00.490 --> 12:02.570
If you have the ball, then all you have to do is attack!

12:02.570 --> 12:04.070
Yeah!

12:04.070 --> 12:05.800
<i>A fierce focus on attacking and scoring,</i>

12:05.800 --> 12:09.580
<i>and not just staying back on defense... is this the key behind Meiwa FC's strength?</i>

12:09.580 --> 12:11.220
<i>That's right!</i>

12:11.220 --> 12:13.880
<i>If your team is just based on defending,</i>

12:13.880 --> 12:16.040
<i>then you won't nurture strong teams or players.</i>

12:16.040 --> 12:19.340
Get back! If they score again, it's over for us!

12:22.160 --> 12:24.010
<i>Sawada whips the ball in!</i>

12:24.010 --> 12:24.840
Damn it!

12:24.840 --> 12:27.580
I've got it! Here's the killing blow!

12:28.300 --> 12:32.220
<i>Morisaki dives and makes an excellent save!</i>

12:32.220 --> 12:32.930
What?!

12:32.930 --> 12:34.490
Nice, Morisaki!

12:34.490 --> 12:35.560
We're saved!

12:35.560 --> 12:39.110
Like hell Nankatsu's gonna lose!

12:39.110 --> 12:41.820
<i>Morisaki's pass reaches Misaki!</i>

12:41.820 --> 12:42.780
Like I'd let you!

12:43.990 --> 12:45.570
<i>He sends a pass forward with one touch!</i>

12:45.570 --> 12:48.490
<i>Only Tsubasa and Hyuga are there!</i>

12:48.490 --> 12:49.390
<i>Kojiro!</i>

12:49.390 --> 12:50.910
<i>Get that ball, Tsubasa!</i>

12:50.910 --> 12:52.290
<i>I will definitely get this!</i>

12:52.290 --> 12:53.160
<i>I won't lose!</i>

12:53.160 --> 12:55.460
<i>Is this the final showdown of the match!</i>

12:56.650 --> 12:58.000
<i>It's another heading clash!</i>

12:58.000 --> 13:00.090
<i>This time they're both even!</i>

13:01.880 --> 13:04.010
<i>They get tangled up and fall!</i>

13:04.010 --> 13:05.260
Tsubasa!

13:05.900 --> 13:08.300
<i>Tsubasa quickly recovers, dashing away!</i>

13:08.300 --> 13:10.140
You did it, Tsubasa!

13:10.140 --> 13:12.460
<i>Tsubasa picks up the loose ball,</i>

13:12.460 --> 13:14.390
<i>quickly making his way towards Meiwa's goal!</i>

13:15.210 --> 13:15.980
Damn you!

13:15.980 --> 13:19.440
<i>Hyuga recovers and ferociously chases after him!</i>

13:19.440 --> 13:21.510
<i>Can he reach Tsubasa?</i>

13:21.510 --> 13:23.370
<i>This is the last bout!</i>

13:23.370 --> 13:27.280
<i>I need to tie and keep my promise to Wakabayashi!</i>

13:27.280 --> 13:29.970
<i>What's all this about football being your dream?!</i>

13:29.970 --> 13:32.290
<i>There is only victory and defeat in football!</i>

13:32.290 --> 13:39.380
<i>If not, take this tackle and prove me wrong!</i>

13:41.740 --> 13:44.960
<i>He dodges Hyuga's sliding tackle!</i>

13:44.960 --> 13:45.840
What?

13:45.840 --> 13:49.080
<i>He fires off a volley from that position!</i>

13:49.950 --> 13:51.350
<i>And it's in!</i>

13:51.990 --> 13:56.270
<i>Nankatsu has once again tied before the end of the match!</i>

13:58.330 --> 14:05.730
<i>He dodged my full force tackle. Impossible!</i>

14:05.730 --> 14:09.530
<i>There's no way I can lose!</i>

14:13.240 --> 14:15.750
<i>Football is my dream!</i>

14:17.250 --> 14:18.520
You did it... you did it!

14:18.520 --> 14:19.560
That was awesome!

14:19.560 --> 14:21.130
You did it, Tsubasa!

14:21.130 --> 14:21.780
Yeah!

14:21.780 --> 14:23.250
<i>Now that's the Tsubasa I know.</i>

14:23.760 --> 14:27.180
<i>You may have lost once to his tackles and headers.</i>

14:27.180 --> 14:29.260
<i>But the fact that you did not lose again...</i>

14:29.260 --> 14:31.900
<i>That shows where your strength lies.</i>

14:31.900 --> 14:34.860
All right, everybody. Just one more minute left.

14:34.860 --> 14:37.470
We've come all the way here. We'll win for sure!

14:37.470 --> 14:38.770
Yeah!

14:39.390 --> 14:40.930
Hyuga!

14:40.930 --> 14:45.400
Takeshi, when the match starts, give me a slow pass.

14:49.190 --> 14:53.330
<i>Tsubasa Ozora, you're skilled.</i>

14:53.330 --> 14:55.720
<i>I didn't think there would be someone</i>

14:55.720 --> 15:00.160
<i>that could go one-on-one with me in this National Tournament.</i>

15:00.160 --> 15:02.170
<i>But all that ends here.</i>

15:02.170 --> 15:04.750
<i>With this one shot, with this one—</i>

15:05.500 --> 15:06.170
This is—

15:07.290 --> 15:10.840
<i>With this shot... I'll render everything up to now into nothing!</i>

15:12.510 --> 15:13.300
Oh, crap!

15:13.300 --> 15:18.390
<i>This is a last ditch shot aimed straight at the goal!</i>

15:19.170 --> 15:20.430
<i>It's no good! He can't reach it!</i>

15:24.010 --> 15:26.940
<i>No! It hits the goalpost!</i>

15:28.620 --> 15:30.300
<i>Nankatsu clears the ball!</i>

15:30.300 --> 15:33.610
<i>Wait! Hyuga intercepts the ball!</i>

15:33.610 --> 15:36.080
<i>He is just not giving up!</i>

15:36.080 --> 15:38.520
<i>You're amazing, Kojiro Hyuga!</i>

15:38.520 --> 15:40.850
<i>This raw obsession to win by any means necessary...</i>

15:40.850 --> 15:42.420
<i>It might even be greater than Wakabayashi's...!</i>

15:42.420 --> 15:43.960
<i>He's in shooting range!</i>

15:43.960 --> 15:46.340
<i>We've already moved into added time</i>

15:49.260 --> 15:52.550
<i>Oh! Tsubasa gets in Hyuga's way!</i>

15:52.550 --> 15:55.550
<i>This time, Tsubasa marks Hyuga!</i>

15:55.550 --> 16:01.560
<i>Hyuga tries to get past him, but Tsubasa is not letting him!</i>

16:02.090 --> 16:05.310
<i>There's no way I'd lose to you! I won't let you through!</i>

16:05.310 --> 16:08.570
<i>I'll win this! It'll be my victory!</i>

16:08.570 --> 16:10.530
Keep at it, Tsubasa!

16:10.530 --> 16:11.690
Hyuga!

16:11.690 --> 16:13.150
Tsubasa!

16:13.910 --> 16:17.160
<i>The stadium is loud and roaring with applause for the two of them!</i>

16:17.160 --> 16:23.660
<i>This match started with a showdown between Tsubasa and Hyuga,</i>

16:23.660 --> 16:28.540
<i>continued with them throughout, and they will be the two to finish it!</i>

16:29.360 --> 16:31.050
Don't lose, Tsubasa!

16:31.050 --> 16:32.880
<i>Stick to the end, Kojiro!</i>

16:32.880 --> 16:35.800
<i>Stick to the end and take your shot!</i>

16:37.430 --> 16:41.850
<i>Tsubasa slips on the mud and loses his footing!</i>

16:42.600 --> 16:43.650
<i>Chance!</i>

16:43.650 --> 16:48.020
<i>Hyuga gets past Tsubasa and into position to shoot!</i>

16:48.020 --> 16:48.770
<i>Now!</i>

16:49.480 --> 16:53.030
<i>Hyuga can't shoot! Tsubasa kicks it away!</i>

16:53.030 --> 16:53.900
I did it!

16:53.900 --> 16:56.530
This guy faked his slip to trap me!

16:56.530 --> 16:57.870
Tsubasa!

16:58.630 --> 17:00.620
<i>Ball goes to Takasugi!</i>

17:00.620 --> 17:01.790
<i>The final whistle —</i>

17:17.840 --> 17:20.050
<i>It... It's a goal!</i>

17:21.600 --> 17:25.080
<i>The referee's whistle ends it!</i>

17:25.080 --> 17:27.100
<i>Nankatsu loses the match!</i>

17:32.960 --> 17:35.340
<i>What a curtain call!</i>

17:35.340 --> 17:37.820
<i>Between two teams that were projected to win it all,</i>

17:37.820 --> 17:42.700
<i>and during the showdown between their ace strikers,</i>

17:42.700 --> 17:46.120
<i>Sawada ambushes Nankatsu amidst the turmoil!</i>

17:46.120 --> 17:52.550
<i>7-6! Meiwa takes a win over Nankatsu in the first match in Group 1!</i>

17:53.490 --> 17:55.920
<i>The match may have been Meiwa's win,</i>

17:55.920 --> 17:59.550
<i>but it's a draw between Tsubasa and Hyuga.</i>

18:02.090 --> 18:03.560
Tsubasa.

18:07.550 --> 18:09.060
<i>Damn it...!</i>

18:09.960 --> 18:13.070
<i>This guy... is crying?</i>

18:13.550 --> 18:15.250
Let's go, Tsubasa.

18:16.170 --> 18:16.980
Yeah.

18:19.070 --> 18:22.470
Nice match, Nankatsu, Meiwa!

18:22.470 --> 18:24.080
It was a great game!

18:25.380 --> 18:27.150
<i>A very loud round of applause is given</i>

18:27.150 --> 18:29.810
<i>to both teams as they leave the pitch.</i>

18:29.810 --> 18:34.460
<i>They did good! Nankatsu, Meiwa! Both of your teams!</i>

18:29.810 --> 18:34.460
<i>Hey, what are guys doing with your faces down?</i>

18:41.370 --> 18:46.560
We might have lost, but it was a great match.

18:46.560 --> 18:48.980
Don't go losing your nerve now!

18:48.980 --> 18:52.560
We're not eliminated from the tournament, yet!

18:52.560 --> 18:53.540
Huh?

18:53.540 --> 18:55.140
That's right!

18:55.140 --> 18:59.610
Two teams from each group advance to the knockout stages.

18:59.610 --> 19:03.760
So if we win the remaining four matches, we'll be able to qualify!

19:03.760 --> 19:05.080
Oh!

19:05.080 --> 19:06.120
That's right!

19:06.680 --> 19:11.250
Tsubasa! A captain should never be depressed!

19:11.250 --> 19:16.550
Forget about our loss today, and let's aim to win every game from here on out!

19:16.550 --> 19:21.080
If we can do that... we'll definitely face Meiwa in the finals.

19:22.300 --> 19:23.640
Yeah!

19:23.640 --> 19:25.000
Then, let's aim for the next one.

19:25.000 --> 19:27.600
All wins!

19:30.380 --> 19:31.520
Yes, Shiroyama here.

19:33.480 --> 19:35.740
Morisaki, it's for you!

19:35.740 --> 19:36.980
Huh?

19:37.770 --> 19:41.170
We lost, but it was a good match.

19:41.170 --> 19:43.990
You did great, Morisaki.

19:43.990 --> 19:46.580
Wakabayashi!

19:46.580 --> 19:49.570
Protect Nankatsu's goal until I get back!

19:49.570 --> 19:51.670
Yes! I'll do my best!

19:51.670 --> 19:54.340
By the way, is Tsubasa OK?

19:54.340 --> 19:57.040
Eh? I'll put him on now.

19:57.610 --> 19:59.260
Oh, Tsubasa?

19:59.820 --> 20:01.260
Yes.

20:01.710 --> 20:02.710
Yes.

20:03.310 --> 20:04.760
Yeah.

20:04.760 --> 20:06.280
It's all right.

20:06.280 --> 20:11.520
We'll win the next 4 matches and make it into the knockout stages!

20:11.520 --> 20:14.560
That's right. You can count on us, Wakabayashi!

20:14.560 --> 20:18.020
We'll definitely win! Right, everyone?

20:18.020 --> 20:20.020
Yeah!

20:20.650 --> 20:22.970
<i>I'm counting on you guys.</i>

20:22.970 --> 20:28.530
<i>I'll make sure to recover quickly and return.</i>

20:31.540 --> 20:38.290
<i>On the other side, in Group 3, Hokkaido's Furano used their teamwork</i>

20:38.290 --> 20:41.130
<i>to get a win over Nagano FC, 2-0.</i>

20:41.130 --> 20:45.630
<i>In Group 4, the match between Musashi FC and Jonan continues.</i>

20:45.630 --> 20:49.010
<i>Oh, there's Misugi again, with a magnificent interception!</i>

20:49.980 --> 20:51.430
Misugi!

20:51.430 --> 20:54.600
What's that?! There's a ton of girls there!

20:56.690 --> 20:58.480
<i>A gentle feint!</i>

20:59.290 --> 21:01.070
<i>Excellent balance!</i>

21:02.220 --> 21:06.410
<i>The audience is left breathless as they witness Misugi's skillful play!</i>

21:07.000 --> 21:10.830
<i>Tsubasa, I'm looking forward to when we play!</i>

21:11.480 --> 21:13.370
<i>Jun Misugi.</i>

21:15.230 --> 21:16.350
<i>It's a goal!</i>

21:16.350 --> 21:20.210
<i>It's their fifth goal and we're just six minutes into the first half!</i>

21:20.210 --> 21:22.090
That's our captain!

21:26.350 --> 21:29.840
<i>There's Misugi after Kojiro.</i>

21:29.840 --> 21:32.870
<i>He's another opponent we'll face in the actual tournament.</i>

21:32.870 --> 21:39.230
<i>Jun Misugi. We can't be champions unless we win against Musashi FC!</i>

21:43.830 --> 21:48.780
<i>My long shot should've been a goal!</i>

21:51.710 --> 21:57.660
<i>But he barely got a touch on it, deflecting it away...</i>

21:57.710 --> 22:05.200
<i>That last struggle... that was my complete loss.</i>

22:05.200 --> 22:07.050
You're Kojiro Hyuga, right?

22:08.570 --> 22:11.050
I'm here to scout you.

22:11.480 --> 22:13.420
To scout me?

22:13.420 --> 22:18.310
That's right. I'm scouting you for our school, Toho Academy.

22:38.790 --> 22:44.670
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.790 --> 22:44.670
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.670 --> 22:50.680
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.670 --> 22:50.680
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.680 --> 22:56.690
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.680 --> 22:56.690
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.690 --> 23:02.150
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.690 --> 23:02.150
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:08.280
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:08.280
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:15.000
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:15.000
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.000 --> 23:21.040
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.040 --> 23:26.050
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.040 --> 23:26.050
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:33.220
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:33.220
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.220 --> 23:39.100
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.100 --> 23:45.990
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.100 --> 23:45.990
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:50.070 --> 24:00.640
COMING UP, EPISODE 16:
THIS IS ACROBATIC FOOTBALL!
